    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d6">

                <pb facs="0177" n="5" xml:id="pg5"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 763.72/3119</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Droppers</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Athens</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-01-09T22:00:00+02:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 9, 1917, 10 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                        <lb/> [<hi rendition="#italic">Received January 10, 10.30
                        a.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>221. Italian Minister informs me conditions imposed upon Greek Government in note
                    of December 31 must be accepted by Greece in principle in 48 hours and 15 days
                    for execution. Blockade raised not until all conditions fulfilled. Italian
                    Minister for Foreign Affairs urges literal acceptance otherwise sad day for
                    Greece.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Droppers</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
